@baseUrl = http://localhost:5076
@apiKey = {{$dotenv COLLABORATOR_API_KEY}}
@runId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Browse products (bounded pages, ordered by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?offset=0&limit=50
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List human developer implementation inputs and confirmation progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/developer-proposals
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Confirm a developer implementation proposal for an open round
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/developer-proposals/developer-1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 1,
  "proposal": "Reuse the existing export service and add Unicode integration tests.",
  "noAdditionalInput": false
}

### Explicitly confirm no additional implementation input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/developer-proposals/developer-2
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 1,
  "proposal": null,
  "noAdditionalInput": true
}

### Browse feature runs (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs?offset=0&limit=50
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Invalid pagination returns 400 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs?limit=201
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get the cross-role synthesis for a run after specialist processing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/collaboration
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
